WEBVTT

00:11:28.434 --> 00:11:34.690
to the pleasure of being
on stage at a major event, performing,

00:11:34.732 --> 00:11:37.109
and the crowd is going wild?

00:11:37.109 --> 00:11:39.778
What's the difference
between that kind of joy?

00:11:40.988 --> 00:11:43.323
AK: They are two totally different joys.

00:11:44.616 --> 00:11:50.414
The joy of seeing these girls

00:11:50.414 --> 00:11:53.333
being articulate today,

00:11:53.375 --> 00:11:56.086
talking truth to power
to the head of villages

00:11:56.086 --> 00:11:58.756
telling them, "No one
is touching us anymore.

00:11:58.756 --> 00:12:01.550
No one have the right
to touch my boob, no."